            <ArticleTitle>KLi3Fe(C2O4)3: a perovskite-like compound with 1 : 3 ordering at both A and B sites.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>13349-13351</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1039/c7dt03468g</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>KLi3Fe(C2O4)3 adopts a perovskite-like structure with 1 : 3 ordering of (Li,Fe) on the B-site and (K,vacancy) on the A-site; there are no previous examples of this type of cation ordering in conventional perovskites.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
